' 19. Take a mock exam (JLPT-style, N5 / N4 …)
' Use case: Take mock exam (Practice) · Actor: Learner
'
' Design patterns:
'   - Unit of work: the result, its practice session, its mistakes and the streak day are saved together
'     (services/mock-exam.service.ts submitMockExam → withTransaction)
'   - Facade: rewardActivities() pays the finishing XP and, once per level, the pass bonus
'   - Repository: mock-exam-result.repository.ts, mistake.repository.ts, practice-session.repository.ts
'   - The grading rule (learning/mockExamGrading.ts gradeMockExam) is a pure domain function shared by the score shown
'     at once in the browser and the one the server saves; the server's grade is the one kept.
' Lifelines use BCE stereotypes: «boundary» screens, «control» use-case logic, «entity» stored data; the database
' keeps its own symbol.
@startuml 19 Take a mock exam
title 19. Take a mock exam
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Learner
boundary "Web app\n(mock exam)" as Web
control "Mock exam controller" as Ctrl
control "Mock exam service" as Svc
control "Grading rule\n(gradeMockExam)" as Grade
control "Gamification\nservice" as Gam
entity "Repository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

note over Web, Ctrl : «Chain of responsibility»: headers → CORS → authenticate → controller\n«Decorator»: action() wraps every controller (error handling)

Learner -> Web : Open Mock exam
par
  Web -> Ctrl : GET /api/units
  Ctrl --> Web : units reached
else
  Web -> Ctrl : GET /api/mock-exam/:level/results
  Ctrl -> Svc : getMockHistory()
  Svc -> Repo : listMockResults() + getMockBest()
  Repo -> DB : SELECT
  Ctrl --> Web : last results, best, attempts
end
alt not every unit of the level reached
  Web -> Web : show "locked" and what to finish first
else level reached
  Web -> Web : show sections, number of questions, time, past results
end

Learner -> Web : Start
Web -> Web : start the clock, show the Fuji trail
loop each question
  Learner -> Web : Choose an option
  Web -> Web : light the next station on the trail
end
alt Learner finishes
  Learner -> Web : Finish
else time runs out
  Web -> Web : finish with timedOut = true
end
Web -> Grade : gradeMockExam(exam, answers)
Grade --> Web : score per section, passed?
Web -> Web : show the result at once

Web -> Ctrl : POST /api/mock-exam/:level/results { answers, timedOut }
Ctrl -> Svc : submitMockExam()
Svc -> Svc : known level? (404) answers valid? (400)
Svc -> Repo : every unit of the level reached? (403) fewer than 20 exams this hour? (429)
Svc -> Grade : gradeMockExam(exam, answers)
Grade --> Svc : result
group «Unit of work» withTransaction()
  Svc -> Repo : insertMockResult()
  Svc -> Repo : insertPracticeSession("mock-exam")
  Svc -> Repo : recordAnswerOutcomes() (wrong answers → mistake notebook)
  Svc -> Repo : recordActivity() (streak day)
  Repo -> DB : INSERT / UPDATE
end
Svc -> Gam : rewardActivities(mock_exam [, mock_exam_pass once per level])
note right of Gam : «Facade»
Gam --> Svc : reward
Ctrl --> Web : 201 saved result + streak + reward
alt saved
  Web -> Web : show "Saved" and "+XP"
else saving failed
  Web -> Web : show the error + Save again (the result stays on screen)
end
@enduml
